%% Memory Recall Flow - From Query to Context Injection
sequenceDiagram
    participant ChatSvc as ChatService
    participant Adapter as memoryRecallerAdapter
    participant Recall as MemoryRecallService
    participant CellRepo as MemoryCellRepository
    participant SceneRepo as MemorySceneRepository
    participant FTS as FTS5 Engine
    participant Metrics as Prometheus
    participant Tracing as Tracing

    ChatSvc->>Adapter: RecallAndFormat(ctx, convID, query, maxTokens)
    Adapter->>Recall: RecallMemory(ctx, RecallRequest)

    Recall->>Tracing: StartSpan("memory.recall")
    Recall->>Recall: Start recall timer

    Note over Recall: Step 1: Full-Text Search

    Recall->>Tracing: StartSpan("memory.fts_search")
    Recall->>Recall: Start FTS timer
    Recall->>CellRepo: SearchFTS(ctx, query, limit=20)
    CellRepo->>FTS: SELECT ... FROM memory_cells_fts WHERE MATCH query
    FTS-->>CellRepo: BM25-ranked results
    CellRepo-->>Recall: cells (FTS matches)
    Recall->>Metrics: MemoryFTSQueryDuration.Observe()
    Recall->>Tracing: EndSpan("memory.fts_search")

    alt FTS returns results
        Note over Recall: queryType = "fts"<br/>fallbackUsed = false
    else FTS returns empty
        Note over Recall: Step 2: Fallback to Salience

        Recall->>CellRepo: GetHighSalience(ctx, convID, threshold=0.5, limit=10)
        Note over CellRepo: SELECT ... WHERE salience >= threshold<br/>ORDER BY salience DESC
        CellRepo-->>Recall: high-salience cells
        Note over Recall: queryType = "fallback"<br/>fallbackUsed = true
    end

    Note over Recall: Step 3: Fetch Scenes

    Recall->>Recall: Deduplicate scene names from cells
    loop For each unique scene (max 10)
        Recall->>SceneRepo: Get(ctx, sceneName)
        SceneRepo-->>Recall: MemoryScene (summary + token count)
    end

    Note over Recall: Step 4: Apply Token Budget

    Recall->>Recall: totalTokens = sum(scene.TokenCount)
    loop For each cell (in FTS rank order)
        Recall->>Recall: cellTokens = len(content) / 4
        alt totalTokens + cellTokens <= maxTokens
            Recall->>Recall: Include cell, mark scene as used
        else Budget exceeded
            Note over Recall: BREAK - stop adding cells
        end
    end
    Recall->>Recall: Filter to only used scenes

    Recall->>Metrics: MemoryRecallTotal{success, queryType}++
    Recall->>Metrics: MemoryRecallDuration.Observe()
    Recall->>Metrics: MemoryRecallCellsTotal += len(cells)
    Recall->>Tracing: EndSpan("memory.recall")

    Recall-->>Adapter: RecallResponse

    Note over Adapter: Format for Context Injection

    Adapter->>Recall: FormatMemoryForInjection(response)
    Recall->>Recall: Group cells by scene
    Recall->>Recall: Build markdown output
    Note over Recall: "### Relevant Long-Term Memory"<br/>Per scene: summary + key facts<br/>Footer: cell/scene/token counts
    Recall-->>Adapter: formatted string

    Adapter-->>ChatSvc: formatted memory string
    Note over ChatSvc: Inject into system prompt
